  "details": "Version: 2020.3.1:950\nDescription of the bug:\nOculus version of VRChat, version 2020.3.1:950 crashes on startup.\nShows loading bar, as in the attached picture, for a few seconds before disappearing.\nNo crash log is generated. Crashes even in desktop mode.\nTalked about it with 2 friends of mine who also have Oculus Rift and they experience the exact same issue. Other reports on the Discord are the same.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nStart via Oculus launcher or otherwise.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\nSee attachments. No crash log generated.",
